Simple Startup
Terminal 1 — VLC
1)

cvlc --extraintf rc --rc-host 0.0.0.0:4212 ~/Music-gesture-Control/music/*

Leave it running.

Terminal 2 — Docker
1)
xhost +local:docker


2)
cd ~/jetson-containers


3)
sudo docker run --runtime nvidia --env NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=compute,utility,graphics -it --rm --network host --shm-size=8g -e DISPLAY=$DISPLAY -e XAUTHORITY=/root/.Xauthority -v /tmp/.X11-unix:/tmp/.X11-unix:rw -v $HOME/.Xauthority:/root/.Xauthority:rw -v /tmp/argus_socket:/tmp/argus_socket -v /home/nvidia/Music-gesture-Control:/workspace/Music-gesture-Control --device /dev/video0 --device /dev/video1 --device /dev/snd dustynv/jetson-inference:r36.3.0


Inside Docker

4)
cd /workspace/Music-gesture-Control
python3 live.py




Controls



🖐️ PLAY → Play
✊ PAUSE → Pause
👉 NEXT → Next
👈 PREVIOUS → Previous
NONE → Nothing

Press Q to stop.
